{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You crashed your car. You found a creepy old house. What could possibly go wrong?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cease to Breathe is a love letter to the golden age of adventure gaming \u2014 the pixel-perfect era of Uninvited, Shadowgate, and D\u00e9j\u00e0 Vu \u2014 back when death came often, and laughing at it was part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Heart, Modern Mischief<br>Hand-drawn pixel art and point-and-click gameplay, just like the classics\u2026 only now you can yeet suspicious objects at other suspicious objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom to Fail Spectacularly<br>Hundreds of interactive items, and no \u201cyou can\u2019t do that\u201d messages here. If you want to try it, try it. If it kills you, well\u2026 reload and try something even dumber.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices with Consequences<br>Multiple endings shaped by your actions, whether brilliant, reckless, or \u201coops, I thought that was a chair.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, Sweet, and Sharply Replayable<br>A bite-sized non-linear adventure you can complete in one sitting \u2014 or keep replaying to see what other nonsense you can pull off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Steam Deck players \u2014 this one\u2019s a PC-only party.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"28 Years","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1873170/43a45aff28250f5a896f8cbae745d03ab5edcb38.jpg"},{"name":"Psychopath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1873170/912f6d69a3417065faa5867122585e851e68a5d3.jpg"},{"name":"Demon Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1873170/1e4e99e5757851e04bca7629ce3f21103941aa64.jpg"},{"name":"Demolition","path":"https://cdn.aka